  "description": "“Wait… you were a pervert?”\n\nYoon Se-young, the top student in the Business Administration Department, has a secret. She secretly watches Han I-gyeol, the most popular guy on campus—and keeps detailed notes about him.\n\nThen one day, her observation journal ends up in the hands of the very person she’s been watching.\n\n“Today, Han I-gyeol played basketball. It’s already that big when he’s not even hard…”\n\n“I-I’m sorry! I’m really sorry!”\n\nAs the words rang out clearly through the hallway, Se-young’s face went deathly pale.\n\n“You can’t just say you’re sorry and expect that to be enough. Not when you’ve been having perverted thoughts like this every day. Am I wrong?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002960)",
